# 21. PROVENANCE / TRUST

Semua visual gaming harus tetap tunduk pada data integrity.

Bedakan:

```text
OBSERVATION
FACT
BELIEF
HYPOTHESIS
VERIFIED KNOWLEDGE

```

Dan:

```text
DISCOVERED
OBSERVED
VERIFIED
TRUSTED

```

Jangan menampilkan "TRUSTED" tanpa verification/provenance yang nyata.

---

# 22. XP / LEVEL

Gunakan prinsip:

```text
ACTION
 ↓
OUTCOME
 ↓
VALIDATION
 ↓
VERIFIED EXPERIENCE
 ↓
XP
 ↓
LEVEL / CAPABILITY

```

XP bukan sekadar UI decoration.

Jangan memberi XP karena arbitrary clicks atau page views.

---

# 23. EVENT SYSTEM / WORLD LOG

Bila data tersedia, tampilkan world event stream:

```text
WORLD EVENT LOG

09:41 NODE CONNECTED
09:42 RESOURCE DISCOVERED
09:43 OBSERVATION STORED
09:45 VERIFICATION STARTED
09:47 QUEST COMPLETED
09:48 EXPERIENCE VERIFIED

```

Gunakan real events.

Jika belum ada event source, gunakan:

```text
DEMO
SIMULATION
PLACEHOLDER

```

dan jangan menyamarkannya sebagai production telemetry.

---

# 24. AUTOMATION

Gunakan automation architecture yang sudah tersedia.

Jangan membuat automation plane baru tanpa kebutuhan.

Audit dan gunakan existing:

```text
ROCKSOUL-GATE
ROCKSOUL-SYNC

```

dan workflow lain yang memang sudah ada.

Pastikan responsibility masing-masing jelas.

---

# 25. DEPLOYMENT

Audit seluruh deployment path:

```text
SOURCE
 ↓
GITHUB
 ↓
AUTOMATION
 ↓
RUNNER
 ↓
BUILD
 ↓
VERIFICATION
 ↓
VERCEL / OTHER DEPLOYMENT
 ↓
PUBLIC WORLD

```

Pastikan status setiap layer dapat diverifikasi.

---

# 26. CLOUDFLARE

Gunakan Cloudflare Tunnel jika public access memang diperlukan.

Architecture:

```text
PRIVATE NODE
   ↓
ROCKSOUL SERVICE
   ↓
CLOUDFLARE TUNNEL
   ↓
PUBLIC GATEWAY

```

Security principle:

# PRIVATE FIRST

---

# 27. DO NOT OVERENGINEER

Jangan menambahkan teknologi hanya agar terlihat "metaverse".

Tidak perlu menambah:

- 3D engine
- Kubernetes
- unnecessary microservices
- unnecessary message brokers
- duplicate databases
- unnecessary AI agents
- unnecessary distributed architecture

kecuali terdapat kebutuhan teknis yang nyata.

---

# 28. BEFORE IMPLEMENTATION — AUDIT CURRENT WORK

Sebelum perubahan:

buat inventory:

```text
EXISTING WORK
├── COMPLETE
├── PARTIAL
├── MISSING
├── BROKEN
├── BLOCKED
└── UNKNOWN

```

Audit minimal:

### REPOSITORY

### GITHUB

### AUTOMATION

### RUNNERS

### TUI

### WEB

### VERCEL

### CLOUDFLARE

### ASSETS

### UI

### DOCUMENTATION

### WORLD MODEL

### DISCOVERY

### TRUST

### XP / LEVEL

### SECURITY

### LOCAL SETUP

